      "writtenOn": "2022-11-16T23:38:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This will set `.alert_signal` to zero, which is a valid GPIO enumeration setting.  Set this to GPIO_LIMIT if the alert_signal isn\u0027t specified.  You should also check this in your tcpc_alert_event().\n\nI don\u0027t see a change to the cros,anx7447-emul.yaml file. So the devicetree can\u0027t ever set the `alert-gpio` property.  You need to either add that property to the emulator, or hard code `.alert_signal \u003d GPIO_LIMIT` here.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 20,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 24,
        "endChar": 0
